{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cobalt-sky","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Cobalt Sky","description":"A vivid blue theme with yellow and green accents.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Cobalt Sky","path":"themes/cobalt-sky.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/cobalt-sky.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Cobalt Sky\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#193549\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#15232d\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#122738\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#122738\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#15232d\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#1f4662\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#0050a4\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#0d3a58\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#15232d\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#122738\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#ffc600\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#ffc600\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#ffc600\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#0050a4\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#1f466280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#ffc600\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#122738\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#ff628c\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#a5ff90\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ffc600\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#ff628c\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0088ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a5ff90\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff628c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9d00\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#80ffbb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffc600\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff628c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9effff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9effff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffc600\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9d00\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Cobalt Sky\n\nA vivid blue theme with yellow and green accents.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Cobalt Sky** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Cobalt color scheme.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#193549` |\n| Text | `#ffffff` |\n| Accent | `#ffc600` |\n| Keywords | `#ff9d00` |\n| Strings | `#a5ff90` |\n| Functions | `#ffc600` |\n| Types | `#80ffbb` |\n| Comments | `#0088ff` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}